const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文把价格动量与交易量放在一起，询问交易活跃程度是否帮助区分后续动量路径。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"“Price Momentum and Trading Volume” frames a bounded research question. Read the stated question together with the named sample, dates, and institutional setting rather than treating it as a conclusion that automatically travels to another market or period."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"公开研究描述按过去回报与成交活跃度对股票分组，再比较分组后的收益行为。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"For “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”, the source describes a deliberate comparison, observation window, and control relation. Those choices are part of its research contract: changing one can change the proposition being tested, even when the method label remains the same."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要区分价格收益、成交量或换手率的定义、分组断点以及形成期与后续观察期。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"For “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”, keep the fields, their availability timing, and the sample filters separate from the original study. A same-named variable, later-revised database, or matching end-of-period date is not automatically a comparable input."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源讨论成交活跃度与动量的联合信息，而不是把成交量单独解释为必然的涨跌信号。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"For “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”, the source supports only the empirical or theoretical relation it describes. It does not turn association, model fit, or historical performance into causality, a directly executable procedure, or a guarantee about subsequent outcomes."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"统一成交量的市场口径和拆股调整，冻结分组日期，并避免让未来成交数据进入形成期特征。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Before extending “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”, record its sample, timing, construction choices, and source edition in a versioned note. Keep the primary-source link and access date so a later reader can distinguish a changed definition from a changed result."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2000)。成交量代理、市场制度和交易成本跨市场差异很大，不能直接移植成买卖指令。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2000) for “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”. Its public description defines the boundary. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/0022-1082.00280",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2000) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Price Momentum and Trading Volume”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。成交量代理、市场制度和交易成本跨市场差异很大，不能直接移植成买卖指令。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Price Momentum and Trading Volume”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
